#: ../../../release_details/9.7/add-geometry-and-feature-edges-dispatchers.md:1
msgid "Geometry and Feature Edges Dispatcher Filters"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/add-geometry-and-feature-edges-dispatchers.md:3
msgid ""
"Two new dispatcher filters provide unified geometry extraction and feature "
"edge detection across all VTK data types. These filters were previously part "
"of ParaView's rendering infrastructure and are now available as standalone "
"VTK components."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/add-geometry-and-feature-edges-dispatchers.md:8
msgid "vtkGeometryFilterDispatcher"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/add-geometry-and-feature-edges-dispatchers.md:10
msgid ""
"`vtkGeometryFilterDispatcher` extracts renderable geometry (surfaces or "
"outlines) from any VTK data object, automatically dispatching to the "
"appropriate type-specific implementation. It accepts all major VTK data "
"types as input:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/add-geometry-and-feature-edges-dispatchers.md:14
msgid "`vtkImageData`, `vtkRectilinearGrid`, `vtkStructuredGrid`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/add-geometry-and-feature-edges-dispatchers.md:15
msgid "`vtkUnstructuredGrid`, `vtkPolyData`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/add-geometry-and-feature-edges-dispatchers.md:16
msgid "`vtkHyperTreeGrid`, `vtkExplicitStructuredGrid`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/add-geometry-and-feature-edges-dispatchers.md:17
msgid "`vtkCellGrid`, `vtkGenericDataSet`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/add-geometry-and-feature-edges-dispatchers.md:18
msgid ""
"Composite datasets (`vtkMultiBlockDataSet`, "
"`vtkPartitionedDataSetCollection`, `vtkUniformGridAMR`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/add-geometry-and-feature-edges-dispatchers.md:21
msgid "Key capabilities:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/add-geometry-and-feature-edges-dispatchers.md:23
msgid ""
"**Surface or outline extraction** controlled by the `UseOutline` flag. When "
"enabled (the default), structured volumes produce a bounding box outline; "
"when disabled, a full surface is extracted."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/add-geometry-and-feature-edges-dispatchers.md:26
msgid ""
"**Feature edge generation** via `GenerateFeatureEdges`. For HyperTreeGrid "
"inputs, this delegates to `vtkHyperTreeGridFeatureEdges` rather than "
"operating on the extracted polydata."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/add-geometry-and-feature-edges-dispatchers.md:29
msgid ""
"**Normal computation** with `GeneratePointNormals` and "
"`GenerateCellNormals`, including `FeatureAngle` and `Splitting` controls for "
"sharp edge handling."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/add-geometry-and-feature-edges-dispatchers.md:31
msgid ""
"**Nonlinear subdivision** for higher-order cells, controlled by "
"`NonlinearSubdivisionLevel`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/add-geometry-and-feature-edges-dispatchers.md:33
msgid ""
"**Cell/point ID passthrough** with `PassThroughCellIds` and "
"`PassThroughPointIds` for selection and picking workflows."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/add-geometry-and-feature-edges-dispatchers.md:35
msgid ""
"**Parallel support** via `SetController()` for distributed-memory execution, "
"with optional `GenerateProcessIds` arrays."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/add-geometry-and-feature-edges-dispatchers.md:37
msgid ""
"**AMR-specific options** including `HideInternalAMRFaces` and "
"`UseNonOverlappingAMRMetaDataForOutlines`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/add-geometry-and-feature-edges-dispatchers.md:39
msgid "**Mesh caching** for improved performance on repeated updates."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/add-geometry-and-feature-edges-dispatchers.md:41
msgid ""
"vtkNew<vtkGeometryFilterDispatcher> geometry;\n"
"geometry->SetInputConnection(reader->GetOutputPort());\n"
"geometry->SetUseOutline(0);           // extract surface, not outline\n"
"geometry->SetGeneratePointNormals(true);\n"
"geometry->Update();\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/add-geometry-and-feature-edges-dispatchers.md:49
msgid "vtkFeatureEdgesDispatcher"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/add-geometry-and-feature-edges-dispatchers.md:51
msgid ""
"`vtkFeatureEdgesDispatcher` extracts feature edges from either `vtkPolyData` "
"or `vtkHyperTreeGrid` input, dispatching to `vtkFeatureEdges` or "
"`vtkHyperTreeGridFeatureEdges` respectively."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/add-geometry-and-feature-edges-dispatchers.md:55
msgid ""
"For polydata input, the following edge types can be extracted independently:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/add-geometry-and-feature-edges-dispatchers.md:57
msgid "`BoundaryEdges` — edges used by only one cell"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/add-geometry-and-feature-edges-dispatchers.md:58
msgid "`FeatureEdges` — edges where the dihedral angle exceeds `FeatureAngle`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/add-geometry-and-feature-edges-dispatchers.md:59
msgid "`NonManifoldEdges` — edges shared by more than two cells"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/add-geometry-and-feature-edges-dispatchers.md:60
msgid "`ManifoldEdges` — interior edges shared by exactly two cells"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/add-geometry-and-feature-edges-dispatchers.md:62
msgid ""
"For HyperTreeGrid input, `MergePoints` controls whether coincident points "
"are merged using a locator."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/add-geometry-and-feature-edges-dispatchers.md:65
msgid ""
"vtkNew<vtkFeatureEdgesDispatcher> edges;\n"
"edges->SetInputConnection(source->GetOutputPort());\n"
"edges->SetFeatureAngle(45.0);\n"
"edges->SetBoundaryEdges(true);\n"
"edges->SetNonManifoldEdges(false);\n"
"edges->Update();\n"
msgstr ""
